{"ID":"20240206103645-pmhyesp","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206103645-pmhyesp","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206103645-pmhyesp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206103654-k69n3pe\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206103648-gyq4i1f\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:323,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206103654-k69n3pe\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:174,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:174\u0026#125;","title":"罂粟壳","type":"doc","updated":"20240902145429"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206103654-k69n3pe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206103654-k69n3pe","updated":"20240206103656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t我国由政府限定区域栽培。\n【性状】\t呈椭圆形或瓶状卵形，多已破碎成片状，直径1.55cm，长37cm外表面黄白色、浅棕色至淡紫色，平滑，略有光泽，有纵向或横向的割痕。顶端有 6"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"14条放射状排列呈圆盘状的残留柱头；基部有短柄。体轻，质脆。内表面淡黄色，微有光泽。有纵向排列的假隔膜，棕黄色，上面密布略突起的棕褐色小点。气微清香，味微苦。\n【性味】\t酸、涩，平，有毒。\n【功效】\t敛肺、涩肠、止痛。用于久咳、久泻，脱肛，脘腹疼痛。\n【炙品】\t醋罂粟壳：取净罂粟壳丝，照醋炙法炒干。增强止痛理气功效。\n蜜罂粟壳：取净罂粟壳丝，照蜜炙法炒至放凉后不粘手。增强敛肺功效。"}]},{"ID":"20240206103648-gyq4i1f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206103648-gyq4i1f","updated":"20240206103648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206103648-e7bukdv.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240722172122-sstvbhu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240722172122-sstvbhu","updated":"20240722172732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 585px;","style":"width: 575px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Ty